26gw|n|To come or bring to an end; to eventuate; to end. ; To come or bring into use or practice.	a:1brs,76,3~1brs,76,3	n:18jp,117,36;1brs,86,6~18jp,117,36;1brs,86,6
26gw|a|Farthest; most remote in space or time; extreme; last; final. ; Last in a train of progression or consequences; tended toward by all that precedes; arrived at, as the last result; final. ; Incapable of further analysis; incapable of further division or separation; constituent; elemental; as, an ultimate constituent of matter.	j:vy9,75,7~vy9,75,7
